<section id="why" style="background:var(--surface-alt); padding-top:96px;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="kicker">Why Choose WCS</span>
      <h2>Independent by design, not by accident</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Experience</span>
      <div class="stat mono">16+ yrs</div>
      <h3>One of the deepest track records in the industry</h3>
      <p>Founder Thor Bjerke has one of the longest-running careers in cryogenic valve service today, including nine years at Klinger Westad before founding WCS.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Efficient Service</span>
      <div class="stat mono">400+</div>
      <h3>Dockings and jobs attended worldwide</h3>
      <p>That volume has built methods and routines few competitors can match — and familiarity with nearly every major LNG shipyard in the world.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Cost-Effective Spares</span>
      <div class="stat mono">25–40%</div>
      <h3>Typical savings against OEM pricing</h3>
      <p>25–35% on valve spares with service, 20–40% on actuator spares — with fixed prices that don't move between docks.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Own Manufacturing</span>
      <h3>We machine our own metal seals, in Norway</h3>
      <p>Unlike competitors, who outsource all seal production, WCS manufactures its own metal seals in Norway — and remains the only supplier for some discontinued valve types.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Environmental Approach</span>
      <h3>We reuse what OEMs throw away</h3>
      <p>Many components can be recovered and reused rather than scrapped — lowering both cost and environmental impact, without compromising safety or quality.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Advantage of Using Us</span>
      <h3>Small, flexible, and reachable 24/7</h3>
      <p>Independent of any supplier's guidelines, we adapt and reverse-engineer quickly, and can be reached any day of the year.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

