      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Unique Market Position</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:12px;">Hands-on experience across every major brand</h3>
        <p>Other suppliers only service their own equipment. Because WCS is fully independent, it's the only company with hands-on experience across all major LNG butterfly valve brands — Westad, KSB Amri, Velan, PK Valves, Royal Goodwin, and more.</p>
        <p>That breadth means one call covers cross-brand technical insight most single-brand suppliers simply can't offer.</p>
